Feature addition: weapon swap system - cycle collected weapons with E key + HUD.

This commit modifies 7 files (+480/-68 lines), spanning 6 TypeScript source, 1 UI/HUD.
This feature extends the Geometry Wars 3D codebase with new functionality. The implementation follows the project's established patterns and maintains compatibility with both single-player and multiplayer code paths where applicable.

Additional context from the commit body:
- WeaponManager: inventory tracking, cycleWeapon(), auto-switch on
  ammo depletion, pruneDepletedWeapons()
- WeaponHUD: compact DOM overlay showing weapon icons, ammo, active
  weapon highlighted with glow
- Input: weaponSwap added to InputManager (E key / Y button),
  MultiplayerInput (E/U), ConfigurableInput (E/U/Period/NumpadEnter)
- Standard weapon always available with infinite ammo
- Same weapon pickup stacks ammo instead of replacing
- Works in both single-player and split-screen co-op

Key files: src/input/ConfigurableInput.ts, src/input/InputManager.ts, src/input/MultiplayerInput.ts, src/main.ts, src/multiplayer-main.ts, and others.
